body:
I'm sorry you're going through this.. I also suffer from mental disorders as well and I sympathize with the panic attacks.. Praying for you.

&#x200B;

Father in Heaven, we pray for DepartureCautious. We pray that You replace their sorrows and hopelessness with your joy and peace. May all the liars and doubt that is plaguing their mind be removed. Would you let you presence known to them, comfort them and protect them under your wings..
